#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:1
msgid "Classe contenant les paramètres de Visualisation haute résolution :"
msgstr "Class containing the high-resolution visualization settings:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:3
msgid "Attributs :"
msgstr "Attributes:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:4
msgid "**Intensity** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`) : Intensité intégrée de la courbe gaussienne si l'option `Intensité fixe` est sélectionnée ; sinon, le rapport par lequel la valeur sélectionnée dans la source sera divisée."
msgstr "**Intensity** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`): The integral intensity of the Gaussian curve if the `Fixed Intensity` option is selected; otherwise, the ratio by which the value selected in the source will be divided."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:7
msgid "**Fixed Intensity** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Garantit que chaque point a la même intensité."
msgstr "**Fixed Intensity** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer. Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Ensures that each point has the same intensity."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:8
msgid "**Shape** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Définit la forme de la distribution gaussienne (isotrope, anisotrope ou taille fixe, de sorte que chaque point ait la même forme isotrope)."
msgstr "**Shape** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`): Defines the shape of the Gaussian distribution (isotropic, anisotropic, or fixed size, so that each point has the same isotropic shape)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:10
msgid "**Size** (:class:`SpinFloat <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat>`) : L'écart-type de la distribution gaussienne si `Taille fixe` est sélectionné."
msgstr "**Size** (:class:`SpinFloat <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat>`) : The standard deviation of the Gaussian distribution if `Fixed Size` is selected."

